<!-- ABOUT -->
<section id="About">
  <div class="container">
      <div class="main-wrapper d-flex align-items-center">
        <div class="text-center">
          <h2 class="mb-3 heading font-offcanvas">ABOUT</h2>
          <div class="fs-font L-R fw-bold">
              <p>
                Premium Events Management has been delivering concept creations, event projects and consultancy within the Hospitality, Entertainment and Leisure Industry for several years in Dubai. 
               </p>
               <br>
               <p>Our objective is the creation of a high yielding long-lasting investment by combining a leading brand with an outstanding and prestigious location, coupled with a proven professional and highly effective management team.</p> 
               <br>
               <p>Dubai's Hospitality and Nightlife scene is prospering, and we firmly believe that the combination of Brand, Location and Management creates a lasting success in any of our venues and projects.</p>           
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
  </div>
</section>

